gnome2000-icon-theme (0.2.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Arranged GNOME 1 icons from to meet the expectations of modern Xfce
      Files are sourced from Debian 3.0, specifically
        - gnome-panel-data_1.4.0.6-5_all.deb
        - gmc_4.5.55-1.2woody6_i386.deb
        - nautilus_1.0.6-5_i386.deb
        - gnome-libs_1.4.1.4.orig.tar.gz
            (for the icons that back then were compiled into libgnomeui32)
  * Modified emblem-symbolic-link.png to have a larger canva size
      so Thunar won't make it excessively large.
  * Create machine-scaled 24x24 versions of several icons because
      the GTK file-open dialog shows them without scaling:
        - drive-harddisk
        - user-desktop
        - user-home
  * Debianization of the initial public release.

 -- Timothy N. Gaskell <tngaskell@gmail.com>  Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:46:00 -0500
